VALUES ('transportation', 'Transportation', 'Transportation (Automotive, Diesel, Aviation, Marine, Rail, and Related Logistics)', 'Maintaining and repairing cars, trucks, buses, construction equipment, farm equipment, aircraft, rail and railcars, boats and marine craft, and other motorized systems.', 'Auto technician, diesel mechanic, collision repair technician, small engine mechanic, heavy equipment mechanic, aircraft mechanic, avionics technician, marine technician, shipfitter, rail signal maintainer, locomotive technician', 3)
